{"c":[{"id":"b99fccd1ca3e2300","sum":"Chrome: top AXGroup is named after the window title and AXWebArea after the page title, so keep both out of element keys (E8); Chrome/Helium reject AXManualAccessibility (-25205) yet expose web AX, Electron accepts it; web pages post no AX notification for DOM text changes (E1).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T100848Z-2317db88abe7ef57","text":"Chrome names its top AXGroup after the window title and AXWebArea after the page title; keep both out of element keys or every key moves on a title change (E8).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T100848Z-7a26e801e62c7446","text":"Chrome and Helium reject AXManualAccessibility (-25205) but still expose web AX; Electron apps accept it. Web pages post no AX notification for DOM text, insert or remove changes (E1).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7284de3ea53779af","sum":"Fixtures and acting: a non-frontmost AppKit app posts AX focus only inside its key window (fixtures makeKey() before makeFirstResponder); caret-screen write/press act only in --act-pids, a subset of --only-pids, and rechecks fail closed on unreadable role/subrole/value/label.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T100848Z-bac1844f3b887c52","text":"A non-frontmost AppKit app posts AX focus notifications only inside its key window; fixtures call makeKey() (no activation) before makeFirstResponder.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T114801Z-32531afb7e4fe1e0","text":"caret-screen write/press verbs act only in --act-pids, which must be a subset of --only-pids; without it the reader only reads. Rechecks fail closed on unreadable role/subrole/value/label.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
